      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/chirag-paswan-slams-delhi-road-blockades-urges-election-commission-dialogue-ptag-3013596-2026-10-09?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
