     <article class="story single" data-beat="health">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">HEALTH</span> · ET Healthworld · 2026-10-09 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>FSSAI Pulls Up Dr Reddy's, Nestle Health Science Over Celevida Claims</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Regulation</span> <span>#Nutrition</span></div>
       <p>The Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) has taken action against Dr Reddy's and Nestle Health Science. The FSSAI &quot;pulled up&quot; both companies concerning advertising claims made about their product, Celevida.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-09/fssai-pulls-up-dr-reddys-nestle-health-science-over-celevida.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The FSSAI stated that Celevida was advertised as providing high-protein support. This support was specifically for preserving lean muscle.</p><p>These claims were linked to the product's use during GLP-1/GIP therapies. Such therapies are commonly employed in weight-loss treatment protocols.</p><p>What to watch: Potential responses from Dr Reddy's and Nestle Health Science.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately captures the essence of the report, though it could have been slightly more integrated rather than using short, choppy sentences.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/policy/fssai-pulls-up-dr-reddys-nestle-health-science-over-celevida-claims/134804017" rel="noopener">ET Healthworld</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-09/fssai-pulls-up-dr-reddys-nestle-health-science-over-celevida" data-title="FSSAI Pulls Up Dr Reddy's, Nestle Health Science Over Celevida Claims"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
         <a class="sh-x" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.6 2.6l10.8 10.8M13.4 2.6 2.6 13.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>X</a> ·
         <a href="#" class="sh-copy"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6.6 9.4a3 3 0 0 0 4.2 0l1.8-1.8A3 3 0 1 0 8.4 3.4L7.5 4.3M9.4 6.6a3 3 0 0 0-4.2 0L3.4 8.4a3 3 0 1 0 4.2 4.2l.9-.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Copy link</a> ·
