       <h1>GKB Opens 100th Store and Names Sanya Malhotra Brand Ambassador</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Premium eyewear brand GKB has announced actress Sanya Malhotra as its new brand ambassador while unveiling a rebranding effort. The company, formerly known as GKB Opticals, is shifting its focus toward a broader fashion and lifestyle identity.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-09/gkb-opens-100th-store-and-names-sanya-malhotra-brand-ambassa.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Marking a milestone, GKB opened its 100th store in Mumbai. The 1,000-square-foot location showcases the brand’s new direction, which integrates vision care with luxury retail. The company continues to offer specialized services, including paediatric Myopia Clinics, at-home eye testing, and audiology services, while retailing international labels like Bvlgari and TAG Heuer.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate summary of the rebranding and expansion, capturing the key business milestones and the new ambassador.</p>
