      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/supreme-court-backs-tn-speakers-decision-to-drop-disqualification-proceedings-against-aiadmk-mlas/article71564397.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
