     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-09 · editor 7/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Tribal Protesters Launch Jal Satyagraha Against Majhgaon Irrigation Project</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Tribal villagers in Madhya Pradesh’s Panna district have launched a month-long protest against the Majhgaon Medium Irrigation Project. Demonstrators are conducting jal satyagraha, or water resistance, to demand fair compensation and rehabilitation for 1,450 families facing displacement.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-09/tribal-protesters-launch-jal-satyagraha-against-majhgaon-irr.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The ₹693 crore project requires 1,552 hectares of land, including 988 hectares of private property acquired since 2018. Protesters allege significant irregularities and delays in the compensation process. While the government claims the project will irrigate 8,370 hectares and improve drinking water access for 43 villages, affected residents continue to stage daily protests against the displacement process.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is accurate but misses the specific context that the protest is a continuation of a larger movement involving other projects and activists.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/madhya-pradesh/tested-by-mud-and-water-in-bundelkhand/article71559245.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-09/tribal-protesters-launch-jal-satyagraha-against-majhgaon-irr" data-title="Tribal Protesters Launch Jal Satyagraha Against Majhgaon Irrigation Project"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
